/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 128 0 R
/T (This project aims to integrate a PLC to enable control of the Sulphur BV and as trial for Optimize Sulphur Consumption initiative by utilizing the Sulphur Block Valve. The valve will be programmed to open and close automatically based on process interlocks, such as the operational status \(open/close\) of the Surge Bin Gate Valve. With the PLC implementation, the Block Valve will support both remote manual operation and automatic control via the HMI interface.)
/E (This project aims to integrate a PLC to enable control of the Sulphur BV and as trial for Optimize Sulphur Consumption initiative by utilizing the Sulphur Block Valve. The valve will be programmed to open and close automatically based on process interlocks, such as the operational status \(open/close\) of the Surge Bin Gate Valve. With the PLC implementation, the Block Valve will support both remote manual operation and automatic control via the HMI interface.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
